    {
      "text": "A forest plot of the difference in specificity (%) between TBST and TST 5mm in BCG-vaccinated individuals: DST 5mm vs TST 5mm 60.12 (Starshinova 2018a, adults 48.30 and children 70.70) and C-TST vs TST 5mm 83.30 (Xu 2021, adults). The overall random-effects pooled difference is 67.39 (24.04 to 110.73).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
